<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Hyundai Oil closes CDU for maintenance.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Hyundai Oil closes CDU for maintenance.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Hyundai Oil Refinery Co said on Monday it closed down its No 2 crude distillation unit with a capacity of 200,000 barrels per day over the weekend for annual maintenance.</p>
<p>A company spokesman said the unit was scheduled to resume operation on June 9.</p>
<p>Hyundai Oil, an affiliate of the Hyundai Group, has a total refining capacity of 310,000 bpd.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
